---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Badge from '../../components/ui/Badge.astro';
import Icon from '../../components/ui/Icon.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Togh Aman Committee"
  description="Official Privacy Policy and Whistleblower Protection standards of the Togh Aman Committee."
>
  <section class="page-header">
    <div class="container text-center">
      <Badge variant="green">Data Protection & Whistleblower Trust</Badge>
      <h1 class="page-title">Privacy & Confidentiality Policy</h1>
      <p class="page-subtitle">
        We hold personal data, complaints, and evidence in sacred trust under strict constitutional privacy rules.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container legal-container">
      <div class="card legal-card">
        <h2>1. Whistleblower Protection & Anonymity</h2>
        <p>
          The Togh Aman Committee recognizes that reporting illegal narcotics, land encroachment, or criminal offenses can carry personal security risks. 
          Consequently, our complaint system offers an uncompromising <strong>Anonymous Whistleblower Mode</strong>. When activated:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>No personal name, phone number, or identity data is collected or stored.</li>
          <li>A non-sequential tracking reference code (e.g. <code>C-2026-XXXX</code>) is generated client-side to allow status tracking without identity linkage.</li>
          <li>Uploaded images and documents automatically undergo server-side <strong>EXIF metadata stripping</strong>, purging all device serial numbers, camera models, and GPS geographic coordinates prior to storage.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>2. Data Collection & Purpose</h2>
        <p>
          We collect only the minimal information necessary to investigate and process community grievances:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Grievance Details:</strong> Sector location, incident description, and supporting documentary evidence.</li>
          <li><strong>Optional Contact Data:</strong> If provided voluntarily, phone numbers and names are utilized exclusively for sending administrative status updates via SMS or WhatsApp.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>3. Non-Disclosure & Strict Access Levels</h2>
        <p>
          In accordance with Chapter 10 of our constitution and the committee privacy policy:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>We never sell, trade, or publicly disclose complainant records to third parties.</li>
          <li>Complaints regarding the Women's Wing and vulnerable children are strictly restricted to the Women's Wing executive team and designated legal advisors.</li>
          <li>Accusations are never published publicly without verified proof. Defamatory naming-and-shaming is strictly forbidden.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>4. Data Retention & Secure Deletion</h2>
        <p>
          Investigative logs are retained until a resolution is reached and approved by the Executive Committee. Upon final case archiving, sensitive identity notes are purged in accordance with our data hygiene protocols.
        </p>

        <div class="legal-contact-footer">
          <Icon name="shield" size={20} class="text-green" />
          <p>
            For privacy inquiries or data removal requests, contact the Secretariat at <a href="tel:923339768022">+92 333 9768022</a> or <a href="mailto:info@toghamancomitee.com">info@toghamancomitee.com</a>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-header {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--color-surface-subtle) 0%, var(--color-background) 100%);
    padding: var(--space-12) 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .page-title {
    margin-top: var(--space-3);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
  }

  .page-subtitle {
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .legal-container {
    max-width: 820px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .legal-card {
    padding: var(--space-8);
  }

  .legal-card h2 {
    font-size: var(--text-xl);
    color: var(--color-primary);
    margin-top: var(--space-6);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-2);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .legal-card h2:first-child {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .legal-card p {
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    color: var(--color-text);
    line-height: var(--leading-relaxed);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }

  .legal-card ul {
    margin-left: var(--space-6);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-6);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-2);
  }

  .legal-card li {
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: var(--leading-normal);
  }

  .legal-contact-footer {
    margin-top: var(--space-8);
    padding: var(--space-4);
    background: var(--color-surface-subtle);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--color-green);
  }

  .legal-contact-footer p {
    margin-bottom: 0;
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
  }

  .text-center { text-align: center; }
  .text-green { color: var(--color-green); }
</style>
